# Screenshots and editor scratch files land in the repository root. They are
# never part of the extension, and an untracked pile of them hides real
# changes in `git status`. `image.png` was once excepted here and so was
# tracked and published; it is a scratch file like the rest and carried
# whatever happened to be on screen, so there is no exception for it.
image*.png
